   "id": "457d3d8d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## ii) Parameters and persisted run\n",
    "\n",
    "`RUN_NAME` points at the same precomputed feature/hypnodensity outputs used by\n",
    "`03_feature_associations.ipynb`; nothing is recomputed here. `PHASES` and `DOSES` define\n",
    "the four-way segmentation used by analyses 3 and 4 (the `late` and `outside` experimental\n",
    "labels are excluded â€” only the paired before/after window is used).\n",
    "\n",
    "Unlike `03_feature_associations.ipynb`, this notebook resolves the run's `recordings` /\n",
    "`tables` / `figures` directories directly under `output_dir`, instead of going through\n",
    "`prepare_run`. `prepare_run` is designed to guard a *pipeline* run (it refuses to reuse a\n",
    "run directory if today's `configs/analysis.yaml` doesn't hash-match the config that was\n",
    "used to compute it â€” e.g. the gap-tolerance sweep runs were each produced with a different\n",
    "`segmentation.gap_tolerance_seconds`, so only one of them can ever match the file's current\n",
    "value). This notebook only *reads* already-computed outputs and writes derived tables and\n",
    "figures, so that provenance guard is unnecessary friction here â€” it would otherwise force\n",
    "editing `analysis.yaml` back and forth just to switch which precomputed run you're looking\n",
    "at."
   ]
  },
